Scenario: cap = 500. Sessions: big live 900 B; three young 10 B each; one old deletable 100 B. Total = 900+30+100 = 1030 > cap 500. Sweep: deletable = [old 100 B] → freed 100 → remaining = 930 > 500 → blockers: ALL non-deleted (live 900 + 3 young) = 4 blockers. Fixed behavior: walk largest-first until held > (remaining - cap): overflow = 930-500=430. Largest: 900 ≥ 430 → blockers = [live 900] only. 

Test asserts: `report.blockers` has length 1 and names the live session. Current: length 4 → RED.

